#large-hook-output">Large hook output</a>.</div></div></div><div data-hk="s1000c1301" class="border-b border-default p-4 last:border-b-0 bg-surface"><div class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Key</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s1000c1302" class="text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">hooks.&lt;Event>[].hooks[].async</code><!--/--></div><!--$--><div data-hk="s1000c1303" class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Type / Values</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s1000c1304" class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">boolean</code><!--/--></div><!--/--><div><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Details</div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-default [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a]:text-link-color hover:[&amp;_a]:text-link-color-hover [&amp;_code]:rounded-sm [&amp;_code]:bg-surface-secondary [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-[0.95em]">Run a command hook in the background without delaying the triggering operation. Defaults to <code>false</code>; <code>SessionEnd</code> always runs synchronously. See <a href="/codex/hooks#run-hooks-in-the-background">Run hooks in the background</a>.</div></div></div><div data-hk="s1000c1305" class="border-b border-default p-4 last:border-b-0 bg-surface-secondary"><div class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Key</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s1000c1306" class="text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">hooks.&lt;Event>[].hooks[].commandWindows</code><!--/--></div><!--$--><div data-hk="s1000c1307" class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Type / Values</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s1000c1308" class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">string</code><!--/--></div><!--/--><div><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Details</div><div class="tex