 <code>allow</code> leaves automatic review available when other settings allow it.</div></div></div><div data-hk="s2000b587" class="border-b border-default p-4 last:border-b-0 bg-surface-secondary"><div class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Key</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s2000b588" class="text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">browser_use.origins.&lt;pattern>.downloads</code><!--/--></div><!--$--><div data-hk="s2000b589" class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Type / Values</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s2000b590" class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">allow | deny</code><!--/--></div><!--/--><div><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Details</div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-default [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_a]:text-link-color hover:[&amp;_a]:text-link-color-hover [&amp;_code]:rounded-sm [&amp;_code]:bg-surface-secondary [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-[0.95em]">Use <code>deny</code> to block Browser Use downloads on matching origins. <code>allow</code> only lets normal approval and policy checks continue.</div></div></div><div data-hk="s2000b591" class="border-b border-default p-4 last:border-b-0 bg-surface"><div class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Key</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s2000b592" class="text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">browser_use.origins.&lt;pattern>.full_cdp_access</code><!--/--></div><!--$--><div data-hk="s2000b593" class="mb-2"><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Type / Values</div><!--$--><code data-hk="s2000b594" class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm font-mono text-default bg-transparent!">allow | deny</code><!--/--></div><!--/--><div><div class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Details</div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-default [&amp;_a]